msgid "Name of the school, for example ``gym123``."
msgstr "Name der Schule, zum Beispiel ``gym123``."

#: ../../synchronization.rst:150
msgid "``location_name``"
msgstr "``location_name``"

#: ../../synchronization.rst:151
msgid ""
"Display name of the school. Falls back to the name if the school has no "
"display name."
msgstr ""
"Anzeigename der Schule. Hat die Schule keinen Anzeigenamen, verwendet der "
"Connector stattdessen den Namen."

#: ../../synchronization.rst:157
msgid "Courses"
msgstr "Kurse"

#: ../../synchronization.rst:159
msgid ""
"Apple School Manager requires every class to belong to a course. "
"UCS\\@school only has the school class or work group, so the connector "
"exports each of them twice: once as a course in :file:`courses.csv` and "
"once as a class of that course in :file:`classes.csv`. Both rows use the "
"name of the group as their ID, so each course has exactly one class."
msgstr ""
"Apple School Manager verlangt, dass jede Klasse zu einem Kurs gehört. "
"UCS\\@school kennt nur die Schulklasse oder Arbeitsgruppe, daher exportiert "
"der Connector jede davon zweimal: einmal als Kurs in :file:`courses.csv` "
"und einmal als Klasse dieses Kurses in :file:`classes.csv`. Beide Zeilen "
"verwenden den Namen der Gruppe als ID, sodass jeder Kurs genau eine Klasse "
"hat."

